WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes fits your day.
That is a useful design choice.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Zen12 offers several listening styles,
from guided words to nature sounds.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
But the seller also compares twelve minutes
with an hour of advanced meditation.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Studies of binaural beats give mixed findings.
They did not test Zen12's hour-equivalence claim.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Try a free format comparison first.
Notice what you prefer, not what you wish the evidence showed.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Learn what you get, what remains unknown,
and how your information is used before deciding.
